   ;   ","cnPatch":"Fortinet FortiSwitchManager访问控制不当漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/649871","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-36635","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新:https://fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-22-174","cnTitle":"Fortinet FortiSwitchManager访问控制不当漏洞","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-00416","cveId":"CVE-2023-36635","hazardLevel":"中","id":3270,"pubDate":1736179200000},{"cnDescribe":"Fortinet FortiWLM是美国飞塔（Fortinet）公司的一个无线管理器。Fortinet FortiWLM存在路径遍历漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未能正确地过滤资源或文件路径中的特殊元素。攻击者可利用该漏洞通过精心设计的http请求读取任意文件。","cnImpact":"Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.1   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.2.2   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.5   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.4   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.3   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.2   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.0   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.5.4   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.5.3   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.5.2   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.5.1   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.5.0   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.6.6   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.4.2   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.4.1   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.4.0   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.3.2   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.3.1   ;   Fortinet FortiWLM 8.3.0   ;   ","cnPatch":"Fortinet FortiWLM路径遍历漏洞（CNVD-2025-00417）的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/649876","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-42783","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-23-143","cnTitle":"Fortinet FortiWLM路径遍历漏洞（CNVD-2025-00417）","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-00417","cveId":"CVE-2023-42783","hazardLevel":"高","id":3269,"pubDate":1736179200000},{"cnDescribe":"Fortinet FortiSOAR是美国飞塔（Fortinet）公司的一种安全编排、自动化和响应(SOAR) 解决方案。Fortinet FortiSOAR 7.2.0和7.0.3之前版本存在SQL注入漏洞，该漏洞源于对SQL命令中使用的特殊元素的不当中和，经过身份验证的攻击者可利用该漏洞通过特制的字符串参数执行未经授权的代码或命令。","cnImpact":"Fortinet FortiSOAR <7.2.0   ;   Fortinet FortiSOAR <7.0.3   ;   ","cnPatch":"Fortinet FortiSOAR SQL注入漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/649866","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-23775","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-22-448","cnTitle":"Fortinet FortiSOAR SQL注入漏洞","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-00415","cveId":"CVE-2023-23775","hazardLevel":"中","id":3268,"pubDate":1736179200000},{"cnDescribe":"Fortinet FortiAIOps是美国飞塔（Fortinet）公司的一款结合人工智能与机器学习(AI/ML) 的Fortinet网络配套解决方案。Fortinet FortiAIOps 2.0.0版本存在日志信息泄露漏洞，该漏洞源于应用对于敏感信息保护不足，经过身份验证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞从API端点或日志文件中检索敏感信息。","cnImpact":"Fortinet FortiAIOps 2.0.0   ;   ","cnPatch":"Fortinet FortiAIOps日志信息泄露漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/649856","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-27784","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://fortiguard.fortinet.com/psirt/FG-IR-24-072","cnTitle":"Fortinet FortiAIOps日志信息泄露漏洞","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-00414","cveId":"CVE-2024-27784","hazardLevel":"中","id":3267,"pubDate":1736179200000},{"cnDescribe":"Fortinet FortiAIOps是美国飞塔（Fortinet）公司的一款结合人工智能与机器学习(AI/ML) 的Fortinet网络配套解决方案。Fortinet FortiAIOps 2.0.0版本存在跨站请求伪造漏洞，该漏洞源于WEB应用未充分验证请求是否来自可信用户。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞通过诱骗受害者执行恶意GET请求，代表经过身份验证的用户执行任意操作。","cnImpact":"Fortinet FortiAIOps 2.0.0   ;   ","cnPatch":"Fortinet FortiAIOps跨站请求伪造漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/649861","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-27783","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://fortiguard.fortinet.com/psirt/FG-IR-24-070","cnTitle":"Fortinet FortiAIOps跨站请求伪造漏洞","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-00413","cveId":"CVE-2024-27783","hazardLevel":"高","id":3266,"pubDate":1736179200000},{"cnDescribe":"Fortinet FortiAIOps是美国飞塔（Fortinet）公司的一款结合人工智能与机器学习(AI/ML) 的Fortinet网络配套解决方案。Fortinet FortiAIOps 2.0.0版本存在代码问题漏洞，该漏洞源于存在多个会话过期不足，攻击者可利用该漏洞重新使用被盗的旧会话令牌通过精心设计的请求执行未经授权的操作。","cnImpact":"Fortinet FortiAIOps 2.0.0   ;   ","cnPatch":"Fortinet FortiAIOps代码问题漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/649851","cnRefe